<title>USA: Atlas ends Vista co-venture, keeps Rayrock.</title>
<headline>Atlas ends Vista co-venture, keeps Rayrock.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atlas Corp said said Thursday it has agreed with Vista Gold Corp to dissolve their joint venture in the Atlas Gold Bar claim block near Eureka, Nev.</p>
<p>As a result, Atlas again owns a 100-percent interest in this portion of the claim block. A joint venture with Rayrock Mines Inc for another portion of the claim block remains in effect.</p>
</text>
